Helmian original emoji set
==========================

Every SVG in this directory is an original work drawn for Helmian
(Helmian Labs) in Helmian's house style — glossy 3D-look faces and
characters matching the 2026-11-04 proposal sheets. No third-party emoji
artwork is included in this directory: no Google Noto, Apple, Microsoft,
or Twemoji assets, in whole or in part.

How they were made: each emoji is a hand-authored SVG (128x128 viewBox)
generated by a small program kept with the project; the animated files
carry SMIL motion (loops of 2 seconds or less) and every emoji also has a
`<slug>-still.svg` static first frame used for reduced-motion displays.

Unicode remains the data everywhere in the product: messages store the
emoji character, and this set only decides how a mapped character is
displayed. Characters outside the set render as the platform's own glyph.
